# Flightradar24
Flightradar24 is a global flight tracking service providing real-time aircraft tracking, airport information, airline data, historical flight data and aviation news.
Website: https://www.flightradar24.com
iOS app: https://apps.apple.com/us/app/flightradar24-flight-tracker/id382233851 
Android app: https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.flightradar24free 

## About
Flightradar24 started as a hobby project in 2006 when two Swedish aviation geeks decided to build a network of ADS-B receivers in Northern and Central Europe. In 2009 we opened up the network, and made it possible for anyone with an ADS-B receiver to upload data to the network. Flightradar24 combines ADS-B, ADS-C, UAT, MLAT, satellite tracking, and other surveillance technologies to provide live flight tracking and aviation data worldwide. We have the largest ADS-B network in the world with over 50,000 connected receivers.

